            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lutzflcat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "8.9.18 One-half tomato was lunch today along with a scoop of low-fat cottage cheese. You do want to make it in the summer when tomatoes are at their peak in flavor. One thing that I like about this is that the stuffing doesn’t overshadow the actual flavor of the fresh tomato, they share equally. Quick and easy, healthy, and most importantly, TASTY!",
